### Sentinel Support — HTTP collection
### Base URL (matches api/.env PORT)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:9529

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### ── Step 8: Observability ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Prometheus metrics (api_request_latency_ms, tool_call_total, rate_limit_block_total)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

# Rate limit: >5 req/s per client (X-API-Key or IP) → 429 with a Retry-After header.

### ── Step 2: Ingestion ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Ingest transactions (JSON, idempotent)
# Reuse the same Idempotency-Key to replay; the prior response is returned verbatim.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ingest/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

[
  {
    "customer_id": "cust_001",
    "id": "txn_1001",
    "amount_cents": 150000,
    "currency": "USD",
    "mcc": "5411",
    "merchant": "Whole Foods",
    "country": "US",
    "city": "San Francisco",
    "ts": "2026-06-01T10:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "customer_id": "cust_001",
    "id": "txn_1002",
    "amount_cents": 2999,
    "currency": "USD",
    "mcc": "5814",
    "merchant": "Starbucks",
    "country": "US",
    "city": "San Francisco"
  }
]

### Ingest transactions (CSV upload as raw text)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ingest/transactions
Content-Type: text/csv

id,customer_id,amount_cents,currency,mcc,merchant,country,city,ts
txn_2001,cust_002,89900,USD,5732,Best Buy,US,Austin,2026-06-02T14:30:00Z
txn_2002,cust_002,1250,USD,5812,Chipotle,US,Austin,2026-06-02T19:05:00Z

### Validation failure (missing amount + merchant) → 400 with issues
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ingest/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

[{ "customer_id": "cust_003", "id": "txn_bad", "currency": "USD", "country": "US" }]

### ── Step 4: Read APIs (keyset pagination) ─────────────────────────

### Global transactions list (keyset; optional ?customerId= filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?limit=50

### Next page — paste the nextCursor value from the previous response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?limit=50&cursor=PASTE_NEXT_CURSOR

### Customer transactions (date range + keyset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/cust_001/transactions?limit=50&from=2026-06-01&to=2026-06-30

### Transaction detail (includes alert score + reasons)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/PASTE_TRANSACTION_ID

### Alert queue (filter by status + risk, keyset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?status=OPEN&risk=CRITICAL&limit=50

### Customer summary (top merchants, categories, monthly trend, anomalies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/cust_001/summary

### ── Step 6: Actions (X-API-Key + idempotent + audited) ────────────
@apiKey = dev-local-key

### Freeze card — no OTP yields PENDING_OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/action/freeze-card
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: freeze-001

{ "alertId": "PASTE_ALERT_ID" }

### Freeze card — with OTP yields FROZEN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/action/freeze-card
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: freeze-002

{ "alertId": "PASTE_ALERT_ID", "otp": "123456" }

### Open dispute → { caseId, status: OPEN }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/action/open-dispute
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: dispute-001

{ "alertId": "PASTE_ALERT_ID", "reason": "customer reported unauthorized charge" }

### Mark false positive → alert status FALSE_POSITIVE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/action/mark-false-positive
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: fp-001

{ "alertId": "PASTE_ALERT_ID", "note": "known recurring merchant" }

### Missing X-API-Key → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/action/mark-false-positive
Content-Type: application/json

{ "alertId": "PASTE_ALERT_ID" }
